[32m+[m[32m### 5.3 14-Step Closed-Loop `DemoTradingOrchestrator` (`orchestrator.py`)[m
[32m+[m[32mEvery call to `DemoTradingOrchestrator.run_single_cycle()` executes in strict order:[m
