[32m+[m[32m2. `02_RECONCILE_UNRESOLVED_ORDERS` (`execution_engine.reconcile_unresolved_orders()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m3. `03_SYNC_CLOSED_TRADES` (`trade_reconstructor.sync_closed_demo_trades()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m4. `04_RECONSTRUCT_ACCOUNT_STATE` (`account_tracker.reconstruct_account_state()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m5. `05_EVALUATE_DRIFT_AND_LEDGER_HEALTH` (`drift_engine.evaluate_trades()` and `reconciliation_report.health_status`).[m
[32m+[m[32m6. `06_EVALUATE_EMERGENCY_STOP_STATE` (`emergency_stop.evaluate_ledger_health()` and `evaluate_drift_report()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m7. `07_ASSERT_TRADING_AUTHORIZED` (`emergency_stop.assert_trading_authorized()`).[m
