[32m+[m[32m9. `09_FETCH_SYNCHRONIZED_MARKET_DATA` (`fetch_market_data_pipeline_result()` across `primary_timeframe` and `higher_timeframes`).[m
[32m+[m[32m10. `10_RUN_FEATURE_PIPELINE` (`feature_pipeline.transform()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m11. `11_RUN_STRATEGY_ENGINE` (`strategy_engine.analyze()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m12. `12_EVALUATE_RISK` (checking `WAIT` $\rightarrow$ `NO_EXECUTABLE_SIGNAL` and `RiskDecision` $\rightarrow$ `RISK_REJECTED`).[m
[32m+[m[32m13. `13_STAGE_JOURNAL_CONTEXT` (`journal.stage_analysis_report()`).[m
[32m+[m[32m14. `14_EXECUTE_OR_DRY_RUN_AND_COMMIT_BAR`:[m
[32m+[m[32m    - When `config.dry_run_only == True`: structurally bypasses `execution_engine.execute_signal()` and `backend.order_send()`, commits `last_evaluated_bar_timestamp_utc`, and returns `DRY_RUN_EVALUATED`.[m
[32m+[m[32m    - When `config.dry_run_only == False`: invokes `execution_engine.execute_signal()` and commits `last_evaluated_bar_timestamp_utc` only after the execution outcome (`EXECUTED_ORDER`, `BROKER_REJECTED`, or `AMBIGUOUS_EXECUTION_REQUIRES_RECONCILIATION`) is durably recorded in the ledger.[m
